      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Most demons are just minions; they lack much thought beyond killing,
          eating, and obeying those who are stronger than them. However, more and
          more demons are starting to use manipulation and scheming to either please
          their masters or gain power themselves.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
