        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: A devil of ambition, but also, of loyalty to his masters. He is the
          strongest out of all of the sins and mainly used as a general.  He doesn't
          bother being manipulative like some of the others because he is content
          being a pawn for his masters. Pride doesn't need to think when stubbornly
          clinging to the wills of others.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
