      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Some people are surprised to find the devil of Lust to be a man. 
          He is also the politest of the bunch and seems "kind" when someone first
          meets him.  However, out of any devil, avoid him at all cost.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
