      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Most people think Gluttony is about over-consumption of food, but
          it can apply to more than just food. Thoughts of loneliness, fear, and
          revenge can spiral through the mortal mind, consuming every waking moment.
          This devil supposedly gets "attached" to his prey quickly, offering companionship
          to those in need of it. Unfortunately, there are always strings attached
          to his outstretched hand.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 1
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
