        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "The whisper of fear, anxiety, and depression.  To this devil, suicide
          looks like liberation, and life is a curse from which he wants to set all
          mortals free.  However, life is a valuable asset that contains possibilities
          of all kinds.  As long as you don't listen to him, you won't wish for wings
          when you\u2019re halfway down."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
