    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I decided to write down a report of the strange disease swimming in
          the air of our home, and to write down my frustration with the nobles. 
          After all, what are they going to do? Kill me? It'd be better than being
          eaten.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 3
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 72.585815
        y: 90.52478
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "It all started when one of the workers in the sweatshop dropped dead.
          A common occurrence, but one with concerning signs. The corpse was filled
          with yellow pus, their ears leaking and their face slowly disintegrating. 
          The first victim was laughing quietly\u2026 almost like he knew what was
          happening, or at least was happy with his death.."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 3
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 5
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 86.7079
        y: 155.17526
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "The council of nobles knew, but when we found that it only affected
          the workers they ignored my pleas to at least fix the laborer\u2019s privy.
          After all, that would require them to spend money on their workers... I
          never thought that would bite us again."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 4
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 4
        originDialogueID: 5
        destinationConversationID: 4
        destinationDialogueID: 7
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 80.000015
        y: 209.95874
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 7
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Some time passed and I ordered for the bodies that were infected to
          be burned to stop any possible contamination. I already knew they were
          dead... But they got up... and that's when it happened.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
