    - id: 8
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Actor
        value: 4
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Every worker started turning into one of those things - an abomination. 
          Even the ones that were still alive were changed, they must\u2019ve been
          pretending to still be normal somehow \u2013 until they rushed and smashed
          all the guard's heads in.  They cheered and could speak, but they weren't
          alive anymore, I could tell. The guards they killed turned into strange
          bloated corpses with the parasites moving their bodies. Me, some nobles,
          and a handful of guards have locked ourselves up in here. Praying for help...
          I hope we get it soon."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
