        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "The Great Annihilation was an event of continental genocide across
          all races.  The God of Free Will, angered by the God of Tyranny\u2019s
          manipulation of mortals, blamed those same mortals for the death of his
          lover. "
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
