      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Who can really resist a god? Though the god\u2019s logic was flawed,
          he still attacked the first Continent, with his forces laying waste to
          all. The Human and Elven kingdoms fell, and it was only thanks to Marble
          Monts, a great dwarven warrior, that we all survived. She is the one who
          slew the herald of the evil god to save us all."
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
