        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The first one is the City of Arell. It has seemed that strange new
          monsters have formed there. There is also a gas cloud surrounding the main
          manor, however we have seen that the cloud doesn't affect anyone.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
