      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: (Styrker signs and rolls his eyes before continuing)  You all must
          know the current world order is filled with corruption - the rich squeeze
          the life out of peasants for more coin while the government does nothing
          and gives nothing back.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
