      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'Madison Walker

          Crime: Drug dealing


          Madison''s
          tests led to us discovering that the chemicals could create different effects
          depending on the person. In this case, she grew an extra arm on her back
          but soon dissolved. We will try it out on the next criminal.'
        type: 0
