      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'Adam Biccino:

          Crime: Council member who refused to resign.


          I
          always gain an unshakable smile when I see one of those old elves who have
          been in power for centuries finally get their deserved punishment. This
          one especially, since he always claimed criminals deserve a second chance.
          Bah. They should just rot in hell. They always should and will when I''m
          in charge.


          The test didn''t go as well; he dissolved almost
          instantly. Shame.'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
