        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'John Whitely:


          Crime: Sexual assault


          I loathe
          these criminals; we should have honestly done this sooner with these animals.
          This one in particular needed a good dose of punishment.


          For
          the tests, he became one of the successful test subjects. It''s obedient
          to my voice, along with the others, and we should be able to ship these
          monsters back to Styrker so that his army can get a fresh resupply of troops.'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
