        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "(A few days later) We have examined more of the Restraint gene in
          the subjects. The annoying thing about this disease is that it's genetic
          and can't be used as a bio-weapon of any sort, or at least not yet. The
          tests we have conducted with the super soldiers and test subjects have
          gone well enough\u2014only losing 3 subjects instead of 20. The king should
          be pleased on his next visit."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
