        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The king has dispatched the first group of super soldiers against
          the recent protesters. The results were destructive, and thankfully the
          collars are working well. I can see the hatred in their eyes, but the collars
          are safely intact, and unless something happens to the king, we are fine!
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
