      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "My father was not pleased when he found out that I couldn't use magic\u2014or
          at least that it wouldn\u2019t work properly for me.\n\nI never understood
          why the Restraint disease was so reviled by dwarves and humans. With humans,
          my guess was that they just hate everything. But dwarves\u2026 they\u2019re
          supposed to be jolly figures, right?**"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 32
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
