        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 33
        destinationDialogueID: 3
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 160
        y: 80
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "It was my turn. I was expecting to die\u2014to finally bring this
          twisted project my father set up to an end. But the Owl must have a sick
          sense of humor.\n\nFirst successful test run. Woo.\n\nI'm much more protected
          now\u2014they can't lose their one successful test subject. But I fear
          that won\u2019t last long."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 33
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 33
        originDialogueID: 3
        destinationConversationID: 33
        destinationDialogueID: 4
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 154.66666
        y: 168.66666
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 4
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "I saw Sabbine\u2019s corpse as they were taking me for tests today.
          They\u2019ve figured out how to replicate the process and are now becoming
          more experimental. The one bit of good news is that the other dwarves see
          me as a leader. I don\u2019t know why\u2014maybe it\u2019s because I killed
          one of the doctors by luck.\n\nHowever, I will find a way to get us all
          out of here.\n\nI must."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 33
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 33
        originDialogueID: 4
        destinationConversationID: 33
        destinationDialogueID: 5
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 152.79999
        y: 256
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "(The memory is bloody and hard to read, but it eventually becomes
          clearer thanks to Callus.)\n\nWe did it\u2014they\u2019re all dead. Every
          single one of those damn doctors is dead... The problem now is that we
          are reviled too. Thanks to those collars, we did things we would never
          have done. So now the general public thinks we are crazed cultists for
          my father...\n\nThough \u201Ccrazy\u201D may be correct. I don\u2019t know
          why, but I feel like I see things differently. My father supposedly got
          killed by rebels, but those rebels just put my sister in charge. Supposedly,
          she helped them out greatly. Good for her\u2014I\u2019m glad she grew a
          spine.\n\nWish it had happened before I got sent here."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 33
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 33
        originDialogueID: 5
        destinationConversationID: 33
        destinationDialogueID: 6
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 135.99998
        y: 350.6667
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 6
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "They are really keeping the monarchy.\n\nAnd here I thought I was
          hearing voices. You would think that after two kings of horror, they would
          remove the monarchy altogether... but I don\u2019t think they can. After
          all, it\u2019s easier to just listen to an authority figure than to think
          for yourself. That\u2019s what the doctors always used as an excuse\u2014we
          are just following orders...\n\nMaybe we need something different."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 33
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks: []
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 155.33328
        y: 431.33337
        width: 160
        height: 30
