        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 1
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "I may be going insane. I just finished talking to the goddess Orin\u2014the
          Lady of Grief and Destruction herself. (Crazy how life is.)\n\nBut the
          plan is relatively simple. We will unleash a horde of monsters onto the
          region, and ghost ships will ensure that no one can escape while the monsters
          run rampant. We will give each city and town a choice: death or a culling
          of evil. Children will be spared and taken to a disclosed location to be
          taught better than how current society teaches them.\n\nThose we will be
          culling are criminals, supporters of the old regimes, and those who cling
          to certain policies of evil. We must remove any stain of the old society
          so that the new society we are building is not held back by the old."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 34
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 34
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 34
        destinationDialogueID: 8
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      - originConversationID: 34
        originDialogueID: 1
        destinationConversationID: 34
        destinationDialogueID: 9
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 160
        y: 80
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 3
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "In this way, we can truly build a world against hate, ableism, and
          one that brings true justice to the victims. Orin, when we finish, will
          be the ever-gentle yet iron fist of justice and crime. As for me, I will
          be executed. Those who build the new society must be completely clean;
          that\u2019s why Orin isn\u2019t helping\u2014only a servant of hers, who
          is now my servant.\n\nI will be executed and give the world to my brothers
          and sisters, the Runic Dwarves, as they are the ones who aren\u2019t directly
          involved. Though there are some who refuse to leave me to carry this massacre
          by myself.\n\n(I\u2019m honored.)"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
