    - id: 4
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Today's the day. I'm going to blow up my old home\u2014my sister
          and countless others... I'm probably gone mad, haven\u2019t I? Maybe. But
          if I can save future generations from the problems of government abuse,
          then I will do it. In order to save the world...\n\nThank you, my diary,\nStryker.\n\n(As
          the memories end, you do see a small diary underneath a bed. It's unreadable
          because of age.)"
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 34
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks: []
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 180.99063
        y: 702.2402
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 5
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "As I was preparing for the plan to save the world, I decided to explore
          it. I wasn\u2019t surprised by the cruelty of the nobles, and while my
          sister was trying her best, she was still corrupt.\n\nI did, however, explore
          the elven territories and an island near our continent.\n\nThe elves were
          very accepting of me and my message\u2014so much so that they protected
          a group of dark elf refugees who had escaped to their land, despite the
          council\u2019s protests. Those protests died quickly after working with
          their new leaders a bit (we wanted to keep the people out of the way to
          preserve their purity).\n\nI\u2019m excited to see them in the new society."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 34
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 34
        originDialogueID: 5
        destinationConversationID: 34
        destinationDialogueID: 10
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      - originConversationID: 34
        originDialogueID: 5
        destinationConversationID: 34
        destinationDialogueID: 8
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 185.04495
        y: 385.36902
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 6
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 20
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "My final stop was at the City of Slaves. It was heartbreaking to
          see how crushed their souls were. They barely had enough money to survive,
          let alone smile, and when I brought up fighting back, they just laughed,
          saying they would rather not die and keep living... This wasn\u2019t living,
          though\u2014it was simply existing. I swore to myself that I would save
          these people, no matter what."
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 34
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
