      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Hey, this is Happi Chaos\u2014I gave you a key to the diseased manor
          :3 So, look. I may have caused some universal bugs in the current universe.
          I'm working on it, so any resets or transportation that happens is me trying
          to fix things. In this case, just head upward and you should be back where
          you\u2019re supposed to be. There shouldn\u2019t be any problems in the
          other levels, but hey, sorry again.\n\nFrom,\nHappi Chaos :3"
