        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Oh my gosh -I love combat - combat the deadliest part of adventuring. 
          It's so much fun.  So as you came into this dungeon - I'll do a little
          explaining.  For combat the enemy has to be approached to actually start
          the fight.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
