        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Once it's your turn all you have to do is move your mouse under the
          monster's feet or over the monster.  Then click,  then select which move
          you wish to do with the tool bar below.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
