        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: However, you must pay attention to the attack's requirments are. 
          You can check the requirments by scrolling over them.  The green circle
          is your main action, the yellow triangle is your bonus action.  Once you
          finish these two moves and wish to move no longer or run out of movement. 
          Then you must hit end turn.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
