        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: The captial is gone, queen dead, most militias are dead, and we are
          sent out to find a desperate way to stop the onslaught of monsters attacking
          our home and the remaining ones.  Surely you know what our situation is.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
