      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: HOHO - don't worry youngster. My faith doesn't pratice any of those
          evil acts.  Yes we worship a goddess of Death - We call her the Lady. 
          We worship her to protect souls while she guides them to their final destination
        type: 0
