        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: My church usually provides comfort to those in grief but are main
          tasks are to free the roaming undead.  The undead are either caused by
          nercomancy or evil blood magic.  We as priests are sent to free the undead
          and guide them to their rest.  But I mustn't go on a long speech.  We have
          a continent to save!
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
