        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I feel complicated.  On one hand the monarchy is finally gone! We
          shouldn't have a Queen nor a King after the last two but the way she was
          removed and the city... (You can tell he is shaken by the death at the
          capital) But all we can do now is focus on the main task at hand.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 47
      isRoot: 0
