      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Self-Taught.  I have a desire to learn on all forms of ethical magic
          so I grabbed as many books I could and threw myself into education.  I
          was and still am a "book worm.  But we have some things we need to focus
          on first.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
