      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I been here before - the so-called city of slaves.  The title does
          it justice.  I came here looking for magical components and I was disgusted. 
          I swore when I came back as a powerful mage.  I would free this place...
          and I aim to still do that here and now.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
