        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'This is your first time being at the castle right? (She pauses her
          expression pondering) I suggest you avoid talking to the nobles.  While
          the Queen you must always respect.  The nobles are weasels and father said
          it''s best to avoid them even if they offer money.

'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
