        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: A great Capitial - one of the few in the lands as most fall due to
          tragedy or corruption but even after corruption and tragedy we are still
          strong.  With the new queen she has been working tirelessly to improve
          the lands after the last two kings ruined well everything.
