      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: That makes sense - after the brutal two reigns of racial and religious
          persecutation - I'm not surpised.  But, maybe I can change that. (He beams
          with a smile)
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
