      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'The current call to action?  It is odd - I heard of the weird happenings
          though I wouldn''t be surpised if the queen didn''t want to risk her already
          in shambles army.

          I wouldn''t be too worried rookie.'
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
