      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Huh? Oh because of the lack of schools... I was self taught - my family
          in Ulgoth helped me with my studies and helping me find books to practice
          magic.  Im quite thankful for them.  Also thank you for listening rookie,
          I apprietate your interest.
        type: 0
