    - id: 48
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 25
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I think the best thing to start about explaining my faith is about
          what my goddess does.  When we die someone needs to collect our souls and
          bring them to our finale resting place.  That is what our Lady main task
          is.  She protects our souls from devils or other entities.  So we worship
          her for her kindness and protection.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 49
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 49
        originDialogueID: 48
        destinationConversationID: 49
        destinationDialogueID: 41
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 1579.5607
        y: 1072.6232
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 49
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 25
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'Ohohoho my favorite topic!  I have two little ones from both my wonderful
          son.  They love to sit on my lap as I tell them about my adventures.  While
          I get some coffee in the morning they rush down earily begging for my stories. '
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 49
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 49
        originDialogueID: 49
        destinationConversationID: 49
        destinationDialogueID: 50
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 2047.8943
        y: 1020.89905
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 50
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 25
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I usually embellish certain parts - remove the more scary or tragedty
          but I always make sure that the people I travel with get their moments. 
          So when I tell my kids about your part - don't worry it will be a grand
          moment.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 49
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
