      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Naturally the rest of the skin-walkers rushed toward us angry.  However,
          with my majestic muscules (He poses dramitically flexing his muscules)
          and Carl reckless flurry.  We beat up all the skin walkers and after a
          quick investigation we found the villagers all safe captured in a cellar. 
          We were given a great feast as a thank you and I do love a good drink of
          apple juice. HOHOHO.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
