    - id: 66
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 26
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: '(He pauses before nodding) I did.  I used to be what the other species
          called a "forest elf" an elf that clinged to their old long faded kingdom. 
          When I was born they were restrictive with everything with dating other
          species with art, music, and even magic.  '
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 49
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
      conditionPriority: 2
      outgoingLinks:
      - originConversationID: 49
        originDialogueID: 66
        destinationConversationID: 49
        destinationDialogueID: 68
        isConnector: 0
        priority: 2
      conditionsString: 
      userScript: 
      onExecute:
        m_PersistentCalls:
          m_Calls: []
      canvasRect:
        serializedVersion: 2
        x: 2382.0667
        y: 912.1518
        width: 160
        height: 30
    - id: 68
      fields:
      - title: Title
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Description
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Actor
        value: 26
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 1
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: 'I first learned magic by an elf councilmember by the name of Enfer. 
          He taught me the basics but when I tried to expand my research with other
          sources the rest of the tribe called me a traitor  forsaking the elven
          magic with the more convention magic.  '
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      conversationID: 49
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
