        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: So this place if one of the previous kings areas... To see if for
          myself.  It is rather difficult.  I believed that kings and queens need
          authority or the system will collaspe more pain would happen if not.  But
          if this is what absolute power could cause... (She grips her sword tightly
          and then sighs and moves forward trying to focus on the mission first).
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
