        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: This last place was surely the hardest to get too.  While avoiding
          all the skeletions, zombies, and other horrors.  But my hope is we can
          figure out why this guy is doing such a thing.  Otherwise I won't be happy
          even if we do beat him.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
