        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Im glad I came when I did.  The amount of evil and abuse of the undead
          needed to be cleansed and Im glad I got to meet this small little party
          of ours.  Hoho it will be a grand story to tell my grandkids.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
