        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: I do not know much of this place but I can tell you - that the other
          two areas we went too were filled with resentment or fear from the dead...
          here the dead are filled with grief and mourning.
