        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: They were the "Special forces" for the previous king.  Were a group
          of dwarfs who had a disease which they couldn't use magic.  Somehow the
          king gave them magic and they went on to cause crimes for the king though
          it seems many of them were taken by the king by force.  So any more news
          regarding their past would be nice for history sake.
        type: 0
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Text
